  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through RESEARCH for GLOBAL ADVOCACY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESEARCH for GLOBAL ADVOCACY will be led by YGlobal&#x2019;s partners Africa Alliance of YMCAs and the World YWCA. AAYMCA will act as mentor to building the capacity of the partners in conducting evidence-research, while World YWCA will enhance partners&#x2019; capacity in global advocacy campaigns, policy dialogues with policy makers and participation at global platforms.  Research finding will be used to back the campaigns and policy advocacy. The main focus on global advocacy campaigns organised under the mentorship of World YWCA will emphasize on Gender equality. Based on YGlobal&apos;s Disability Inclusion Policy, all partners are also required to engage youth with disabilities as participants in global advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
